# ==============================================================
# MAZE - TELEPORT PLATES
# ==============================================================
# Script type : walk
# Bind to     : the block UNDER each of the 2 pressure plates
#               (2 binds, same paste):
#                 Plate 1: 11407 162 10964 (plate at 11407 163 10964)
#                 Plate 2: 11405 162 11002 (plate at 11405 163 11002)
#               A walk script fires when the player's feet enter the
#               space above the bound block, which is where the
#               plate sits.
# Map/area    : [FILL IN: map name]
# Import      : /script import walk <paste URL>, then click the block
#
# What it does:
#   Stepping on either pressure plate teleports the player to
#   stand on 11481 162 10970, facing north. Happens every time;
#   no variables, no message.
#
# Requires: nothing
#
# Map coordinates used inside this script:
#   Destination: 11481.5 163 10970.5 (centre of the top of block
#   11481 162 10970), yaw 180 = facing north, pitch 0
# ==============================================================
@bypass /tp {{player.getName()}} 11481.5 163 10970.5 180 0
